  "solution": {
    "text": "Shortest distance $=$ perpendicular distance $=\\left|\\frac{-2 \\times 12+4 \\times 1+3 \\times 3-327}{\\sqrt{144+9+16}}\\right|=26$\n$\\therefore$ Shortest distance\n$$=26-\\sqrt{4+1+15+9}=26-13=13 \\quad[\\because 26-r]$$",
